### =========================
### ORCHESTRATOR API TESTS
### =========================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@orderId = 01a10131-40db-780d-8f1c-9a4b0789cfd3
# Примечание: реальные UUID v4 ресурсов каталогов можно получить через /search:
# GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/flight/search
# GET http://localhost:3002/api/v1/hotel/search
# GET http://localhost:3003/api/v1/insurance/search
# GET http://localhost:3004/api/v1/transfer/search
@flightResourceId = a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11
@hotelResourceId = b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a12
@insuranceResourceId = c0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a13
@transferResourceId = d0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a14


### 1. Создать заказ с двумя шагами
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}"
    }
  ]
}


### 2. Создать полный составной заказ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "INSURANCE",
      "resourceId": "{{insuranceResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TRANSFER",
      "resourceId": "{{transferResourceId}}"
    }
  ]
}


### 2.1. Создать заказ со всеми ресурсами (туда/обратно), пассажирами и контактами заказчика
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "INSURANCE",
      "resourceId": "{{insuranceResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TRANSFER",
      "resourceId": "{{transferResourceId}}"
    }
  ],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "type": "ADULT",
      "first_name": "Иван",
      "last_name": "Иванов",
      "birth_date": "1990-05-15",
      "citizenship": "Россия",
      "document_type": "Паспорт РФ",
      "document_number": "4510 123456"
    },
    {
      "type": "CHILD",
      "first_name": "Анна",
      "last_name": "Иванова",
      "birth_date": "2015-08-20",
      "citizenship": "Россия",
      "document_type": "Свидетельство о рождении",
      "document_number": "II-АБ 654321"
    },
    {
      "type": "INFANT",
      "first_name": "Михаил",
      "last_name": "Иванов",
      "birth_date": "2024-01-10",
      "citizenship": "Россия",
      "document_type": "Свидетельство о рождении",
      "document_number": "III-ВГ 789012"
    }
  ],
  "customer_contact": {
    "phone": "+79991234567",
    "email": "ivanov@example.com"
  }
}


### 2.2. Создать заказ со стоимостью шагов и расчётом сервисного сбора (0.67%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}",
      "price": 15000.00
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}",
      "price": 8500.00
    },
    {
      "type": "INSURANCE",
      "resourceId": "{{insuranceResourceId}}",
      "price": 1200.00
    },
    {
      "type": "TRANSFER",
      "resourceId": "{{transferResourceId}}",
      "price": 2500.00
    }
  ],
  "customer_contact": {
    "phone": "+79991234567",
    "email": "ivanov@example.com"
  }
}


### 2.3. Создать заказ с бронированием нескольких номеров в одном отеле
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}",
      "price": 15000.00
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}",
      "roomsCount": 2,
      "rooms": [
        {
          "category": "Люкс",
          "tariff": "С завтраком",
          "price": 12000.00,
          "stayConditions": "Завтрак 'шведский стол' включен, бесплатная отмена до 14:00 дня заезда"
        },
        {
          "category": "Стандарт",
          "tariff": "Без питания",
          "price": 7000.00,
          "stayConditions": "Невозвратный тариф, заезд после 14:00, выезд до 12:00"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "INSURANCE",
      "resourceId": "{{insuranceResourceId}}",
      "price": 1200.00
    }
  ],
  "passengers": [
    {
      "type": "ADULT",
      "first_name": "Иван",
      "last_name": "Иванов",
      "birth_date": "1990-05-15",
      "citizenship": "Россия",
      "document_type": "Паспорт РФ",
      "document_number": "4510 123456"
    },
    {
      "type": "ADULT",
      "first_name": "Елена",
      "last_name": "Иванова",
      "birth_date": "1992-09-20",
      "citizenship": "Россия",
      "document_type": "Паспорт РФ",
      "document_number": "4510 654321"
    }
  ],
  "customer_contact": {
    "phone": "+79991234567",
    "email": "ivanov@example.com"
  }
}



### 3. Получить заказ по ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}


### =========================
### VALIDATION TESTS
### =========================

### 4. Пустой список bookings
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": []
}


### 5. bookings = null
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": null
}


### 6. resourceId = null
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": null
    }
  ]
}


### 7. type = null
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": null,
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    }
  ]
}


### 8. Дублирующийся тип бронирования
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "b0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a99"
    }
  ]
}


### 9. Слишком много шагов
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "resourceId": "{{hotelResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "INSURANCE",
      "resourceId": "{{insuranceResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "TRANSFER",
      "resourceId": "{{transferResourceId}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "50000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005"
    }
  ]
}


### 10. Некорректный BookingType
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "PLANE",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    }
  ]
}


### 11. Пустое тело
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json


### 12. Некорректный JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookings": [
    {
      "type": "FLIGHT",
      "resourceId": "{{flightResourceId}}"
    }


### =========================
### NOT FOUND / PATH TESTS
### =========================

### 13. Несуществующий заказ
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### 14. Некорректный UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/not-a-uuid


### 15. Запустить обработку заказа
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/start


### 16. Отменить заказ
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
